--- !u!1001 &213265867473063584
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1496952}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 780556209432170279, guid: 86dce1e71ed0147e9ac9f8443bc57e33, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.lines.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 780556209432170279, guid: 86dce1e71ed0147e9ac9f8443bc57e33, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Eek! It's so dark in there, I can't feel my legs...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 780556209432170279, guid: 86dce1e71ed0147e9ac9f8443bc57e33, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: I was supposed to illuminate the flowers inside but I ran out of energy.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 780556209432170279, guid: 86dce1e71ed0147e9ac9f8443bc57e33, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: Now I'm stuck here! Out of all places, did it have to be here?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 780556209432170279, guid: 86dce1e71ed0147e9ac9f8443bc57e33, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: I should have visited the three energy flowers before coming to such
        a dangerous place...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 780556209432170279, guid: 86dce1e71ed0147e9ac9f8443bc57e33, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: I should have collected the energy flowers I saw on the way here...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 780556209432170279, guid: 86dce1e71ed0147e9ac9f8443bc57e33, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.lines.Array.data[5]'
      value: I think I saw three perfect energy flowers nearby, can you please help
        me find them?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 780556209432170279, guid: 86dce1e71ed0147e9ac9f8443bc57e33, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.lines.Array.data[6]'
      value: I think I saw three energy flowers around here...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
